        I'm Bharat — a Software Engineer who likes turning messy data and messy
        problems into things that actually work.
      </p>
      <p class="text-xl font-light text-gray-600 mb-6">
        Right now I'm doing my MSc in Software Engineering at the University of
        Limerick, Ireland. Before that, I spent my time building things across
        data analytics, backend development, and the occasional Salesforce
        rabbit hole — working with Python, SQL, Apex, and a fair bit of Excel
